  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "파앗!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CC55700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안녕! 커다란 파르빗이 나타났을 때는\n도와줘서 고마웠어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548B15500210020CEE4B2E4B7800020D30CB974BE57C7740020B098D0C0B0ACC7440020B54CB294000AB3C4C640C918C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6E0C5B4002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그때는 녀석과 네가 싸우는 모습을\n지켜보는 것밖에는 하지 못했지만...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B54CB2940020B140C11DACFC0020B124AC000020C2F8C6B0B2940020BAA8C2B5C744000AC9C0CF1CBCF4B2940020AC83BC16C5D0B2940020D558C9C00020BABBD588C9C0B9CC002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가슴속 깊은 곳에 작게나마\n불이 붙은 것 같은 기분이 들었어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00C2B4C18D0020AE4AC7400020ACF3C5D00020C791AC8CB098B9C8000ABD88C7740020BD99C7400020AC830020AC19C7400020AE30BD84C7740020B4E4C5C8C5B4002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너처럼 강해지고 싶다고 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108CC98B7FC0020AC15D574C9C0ACE00020C2F6B2E4ACE00020B9D0C774C57C002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 뒤로 죽을 각오로 노력해 왔어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n트레이너로서도 여행자로서도\n처음부터 다시 시작한 느낌이랄까.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020B4A4B85C0020C8FDC7440020AC01C624B85C0020B178B825D5740020C654C5B4002E00100001BE01000AD2B8B808C774B108B85CC11CB3C40020C5ECD589C790B85CC11CB3C4000ACC98C74CBD80D1300020B2E4C2DC0020C2DCC791D55C0020B290B08CC774B784AE4C002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!\n지금의 나와 승부해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000021000AC9C0AE08C7580020B098C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C918002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커다란 유대를 쌓아 온\n나의 동료들을 네게 보여 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4B2E4B7800020C720B300B97C0020C313C5440020C628000AB098C7580020B3D9B8CCB4E4C7440020B124AC8C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...하하,\n이거 흥분돼서 전율마저 느껴지는걸.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n승부할 준비가 되면\n언제든지 말을 걸어 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002ED558D558002C000AC774AC700020D765BD84B3FCC11C0020C804C728B9C8C8000020B290AEF4C9C0B294AC78002E00100001BE01000AC2B9BD80D5600020C900BE44AC000020B418BA74000AC5B8C81CB4E0C9C00020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나와 승부할 준비는\n완벽하게 됐니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C6400020C2B9BD80D5600020C900BE44B294000AC644BCBDD558AC8C0020B410B2C8003F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "완벽해요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C644BCBDD574C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아직 안 됐어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C9C10020C5480020B410C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오케이!\n그럼, 바로 시작해 볼까!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624CF00C7740021000AADF8B7FC002C0020BC14B85C0020C2DCC791D5740020BCFCAE4C002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파아앗!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CC544C557002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가자...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00C790002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커어어어다란!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4C5B4C5B4C5B4B2E4B780002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "유대를 쌓은!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C720B300B97C0020C313C740002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 동료들이여!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020B3D9B8CCB4E4C774C5EC00210021002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파르빗!\n가장 커다란 유대를 보여 주자!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CB974BE570021000AAC00C7A50020CEE4B2E4B7800020C720B300B97C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC7900021002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어땠어?\n우두머리를 잔뜩 잡아서 키웠어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B560C5B4003F000AC6B0B450BA38B9ACB97C0020C794B7290020C7A1C544C11C0020D0A4C6E0C5B4002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우두머리는 뭔가\n야생의 힘이 넘치는 느낌이란 말이지...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B450BA38B9ACB2940020BB54AC00000AC57CC0DDC7580020D798C7740020B118CE58B2940020B290B08CC774B7800020B9D0C774C9C0002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어쩌면 태곳적에는\n우두머리들이 잔뜩 있었을지도 몰라!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4CA4CBA740020D0DCACF3C801C5D0B294000AC6B0B450BA38B9ACB4E4C7740020C794B7290020C788C5C8C744C9C0B3C40020BAB0B77C002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "넓은 세계로 나가야만 한다는 생각으로\n나고 자란 미르를 떠났었지만...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B113C7400020C138ACC4B85C0020B098AC00C57CB9CC0020D55CB2E4B2940020C0DDAC01C73CB85C000AB098ACE00020C790B7800020BBF8B974B97C0020B5A0B0ACC5C8C9C0B9CC002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금은 다시 이곳에 머무르며\n새로운 발견과 만남을 즐기는 중이야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE08C7400020B2E4C2DC0020C774ACF3C5D00020BA38BB34B974BA70000AC0C8B85CC6B40020BC1CACACACFC0020B9CCB0A8C7440020C990AE30B2940020C911C774C57C002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...그러면서\n문득 깨달은 것이 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EADF8B7ECBA74C11C000ABB38B4DD0020AE68B2ECC7400020AC83C7740020C788C5B4002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "낯선 나라든 익숙한 도시든\n여행이라고 생각하면 여행이 된다는 거야!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n중요한 건 그걸 통해 무엇을 얻느냐고.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0AFC1200020B098B77CB4E00020C775C219D55C0020B3C4C2DCB4E0000AC5ECD589C774B77CACE00020C0DDAC01D558BA740020C5ECD589C7740020B41CB2E4B2940020AC70C57C002100100001BE01000AC911C694D55C0020AC740020ADF8AC780020D1B5D5740020BB34C5C7C7440020C5BBB290B0D0ACE0002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는 당분간 더 미르에 머물면서\n나만의 여행을 즐길 생각이야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B2940020B2F9BD84AC040020B3540020BBF8B974C5D00020BA38BB3CBA74C11C000AB098B9CCC7580020C5ECD589C7440020C990AE380020C0DDAC01C774C57C002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파앗! 파앗!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CC55700210020D30CC55700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해 줘서 고마워.\n언젠가는 너를 따라잡고 말겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
